{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOB RECRUITMENT: FOREST OFFICER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Payment:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>$500 / Night Shift</strong><br><i>Terms &amp; Conditions: Only valid if employee survives the entire shift.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Description:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surveillance</strong>: Monitor all forest cameras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense</strong>: Prevent cannibals from breaching cabin gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeding Duty</strong>: Deliver \u201cFOOD\u201d into the well whenever you hear crying.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Duties:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair security systems during interference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor generator power and refill fuel as needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>UV flashlight</strong> to repel cannibals \u2014 their skin burns under it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skills Required:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic computer knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prior experience with horror games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to carry heavy packages (<i>bodies</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must not be afraid of the dark\u2026 <i>too much</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cannibal Behavior Report:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cannibal follows a different path to approach you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>hide in the dark</strong> (use your flashlight).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>lurk beneath cameras</strong> (listen for breathing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>sabotage cameras, the generator, and other systems.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more\u2026</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This job contract is <strong>legally and spiritually binding.</strong><br>Resignation before completing the <strong>2-night shift</strong> is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i>If you fail to feed the cannibals, then you need to feed yourself.</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030650?t=1758181212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030650/c5e10541c91fa5542dae53baa154f2ffc35e5327/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758181212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030650/5c03a86dacdab44d129f515533104a7905706840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758181212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030650/5c03a86dacdab44d129f515533104a7905706840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758181212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains intense violence and gore which is not appropriate for all ages."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOB RECRUITMENT: FOREST OFFICER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Payment:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>$500 / Night Shift</strong><br><i>Terms &amp; Conditions: Only valid if employee survives the entire shift.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Description:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surveillance</strong>: Monitor all forest cameras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense</strong>: Prevent cannibals from breaching cab